[
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Thank you so much, Sophie.\nI look forward to your next request as well."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Thank you so much, Sophie!\nWhat will you give me next?"
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "Thank you for all these wonderful gifts.\nI'm looking forward to the main Linde Festival!"
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "While I'm happy you're so dedicated to your studies, don't overdo it.\nI want to spend the day having fun with Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "When Sophie is working hard thinking of me,\nI'm thinking of Sophie too."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "This time I spend together with Sophie...\nI'll treasure every moment of it."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "This is really wonderful!\nYou've grown so much, Sophie."
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "This is...! It's amazing, Sophie!\nAs your mentor, I'm so proud."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "Good work, Sophie.\nDid you find everything you were looking for?"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "You've brought me a gift.\nWhat are you going to show me?"
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "Thank you, Ryza.\nI'll be counting on you next time too."
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "Thank you, Ryza!\nI can't wait to see what you'll give me next!"
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Thank you for all of these.\nThey're all wonderful! As expected of Ryza!"
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": "Ryza, aren't you tired? Let's take a break.\nI have some special tea and snacks saved up."
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "When I'm working together with Ryza, everything is so much fun,\nand feels really special."
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": "To me, Ryza is my one and only precious best friend.\nLet's stay together forever and ever!"
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "This is really amazing!\nAs expected of Ryza!"
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "To think you could prepare something this wonderful...!\nYou're amazing, Ryza!"
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "Good work, Ryza.\nHow are you holding up?"
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Ah, Ryza!\nWhat are you going to show me next?"
